class ores::utility::domain::hierarchy {
    {static} +build_tree(rows : vector<hierarchy_flat_row>) : vector<hierarchy_node>
}
note top of "ores::utility::domain::hierarchy"
Free function: assembles the flat rows into a forest. A row whose
parent is absent from the input becomes an extra root rather than
being dropped.
end note

note right of "ores::utility::domain::result"
protocol.hpp is the component's hand-written wire envelope. It
reaches 245 C++ files outside the component and the codegen
templates include it, so it is load-bearing and cannot become a
per-entity model. This is the M06 exception, and the template
dependency is the reason.
end note

