The rfl Parser specialisation in time_point_parser.hpp. It reads
and writes the ISO 8601 UTC form that
ores.platform::time::datetime owns.
end note

note right of "ores::utility::serialization::error_code"
Misplaced: it speaks the retired binary protocol and belongs with
messaging. Its one remaining consumer is
ores.iam.core/service/signup_service.hpp, so the move is recorded
for separate work rather than done here.
end note

